## Project Title
Pocket Smart AI – Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

## Idea
Pocket Smart AI is an AI-based budget management project designed to help users manage their personal income and expenses.

## Brainstorming Points
- Track daily and monthly expenses.
- Manage monthly income.
- Set a personal budget limit.
- Categorize expenses.
- Calculate total spending and remaining balance.
- Analyze the user's spending habits.
- Provide AI-based budget recommendations.
- Help users make better spending decisions.

## Objective
The main objective of Pocket Smart AI is to provide a simple and intelligent system for managing personal budgets and analyzing expenses.
